        "quote": "(a) In conformance with K.S.A. 12-3014 and 12-3015 , the Governing Body hereby authorizes by the adoption of Ordinance No. 20243 the recodification of ordinances of the City of Topeka, Kansas, as set out in TMC Titles 1 through 18 and the Appendices, and titled “The Code of the City of Topeka, Kansas, 2020,” is hereby adopted and ordained as “The Code of the City of Topeka, Kansas, 2020” (hereinafter the “Code”). Ordinance No. 20243 and the Code shall become effective when the City Clerk certifies that the Code, as published in book form, is a true and correct copy of the ordinances contained therein.",
