        },
        "quote": "(d) If for any reason any title, chapter, article, section, subsection, sentence, portion or part of the Code, or the application thereof to any person or circumstances, is declared to be unconstitutional or invalid, such decision will not affect the validity of the remaining portions of the Code.",
